    <chapters>
      <chapter>
        <rn>1</rn>
        <name>ces kun tu bzang po klong drug pa zhes bya ba'i rgyud / rang bzhin rdzogs pa chen po'i don bstan pa las/ chos thams cad dus gsum mnyam pa nyid du bstan pa'i klong zhes bya ste rdzogso/ / lha'i skye gnas dag par byed pa chos / nyid rtsol ba dang ba'i skabs te dang po</name>
